From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Collins Ikechukwu <collinschristroa@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:18:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] scf: country-only geo, frontend-only client info, query
 stripping

- SCF_COUNTRY_ONLY: cut IPs to /24 or /48 before the geo lookup; never
  store region or city.
- SCF_FRONTEND_ONLY: ignore caller-supplied ip, userAgent, browser, os
  and device on /api/send, so events reflect the real browser request.
- SCF_STRIP_QUERY: store utm_* parameters only; drop ad click ids and
  referrer query strings.

All three are off unless set, so behavior matches upstream by default.
